Source: once
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Armbian <info@armbian.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), curl, ca-certificates
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/basecamp/once

Package: once
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, docker.io | docker-ce
Description: CLI and TUI to install and manage self-hosted web apps
 Once installs web apps as Docker containers and keeps them up to date.
 Repack of the static release binary from GitHub.
 .
 The once-background service runs background tasks. It is not enabled
 by default. Enable it with:
 systemctl enable --now once-background.service
